  "title": "Information Events On Open Access On 30 January 2017",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "ETH-Bibliothek will be conducting a survey on open access in February 2017. On 1 February, all academic staff members at ETH Zurich will receive a personal link to the online questionnaire via email.\n\nBeforehand, however, ETH-Bibliothek is holding two information events, which anyone interested is more than welcome to attend:\n\nDate Monday 30 January 2017\n\nVenue Hönggerberg, HPV G 5: 12:00 – 1:00 p.m. Zentrum, HG E 3: 5:00 – 6:00 p.m.\n\nThe event will be held in English. There is no need to register."
    }
  ],
